atlas command

architecture native-command-dispatch
  canonical_name NativeCommandDispatch
  family command
  domain Command / Native Entry
  semantic_question How does a native organ resolve a declared verb once without duplicating string dispatch or laundering a verb into authority?
  purpose Shares a sorted, exact command lookup while each semantic owner retains its own argument grammar, database mode, handler, and refusal behavior.
