  invariant command names are unique and sorted within each owner's descriptor table; unknown verbs are refused before database creation or network initialization where that entrypoint has no dynamic command fallback
  invariant the atlas owner list drives discovery of native command tables and the structural audit refuses new string dispatch in a registered owner
  invariant ExternalEstate records direct, read-only, and schema-writing modes and the exact database option in each descriptor, opening a read-only database only once for each read command
  invariant Runtime resolves only the selected sibling binary on ordinary delegated and special commands; doctor intentionally resolves all sixteen; unknown runtime verbs retain the dynamic capability passthrough
  invariant Queue command descriptors preserve minimum argument counts and resolve account-inbox and account-work alongside every WorkGraph verb, refusing unknown or incomplete input before an owner opens its store
  invariant Index command descriptors preserve minimum argument counts and share the existing per-command limit option parser without changing artifact identity or collapse authority
  invariant Facet resolves the verb before corpus loading; the recognized verb does not promote candidate_match into a compiled or enacted contract
  invariant Discipl resolves the top-level verb once while actors and contracts retain explicit nested grammar and refusal on unsupported subcommands
  invariant Family resolves help, unknown, and incomplete verbs without loading its catalog, and its display modes reuse the resolved numeric command identity
  invariant Attention and Admission resolve every verb, including Admission's read-only memory inspection, before opening or mutating the declared SQLite store, and their command handlers retain the original refusal behavior
  invariant WebAddress resolves its site and detail-depth special modes through the same descriptor table as public verbs before either route reaches an owner
  invariant OperatorStore resolves archive, init, inspect or reconcile-reverted before it opens the declared queue database; init requires durable SQLite, inspect stays read-only, and each STOP-gated transition requires a same-directory STOP before its durable transaction
  invariant Stitch resolves the reconstruction verb once while retaining each operator DAG command's own required arguments and refusing to treat a plan as a completed materialization
  invariant Stitch compiles a recipe through direct compiler argv with a bounded source filename, rather than interpreting recipe or output bytes as shell syntax
  forbidden_inference a recognized command -> valid arguments, a current owner closure, provider or institutional authority, evidence admission, or permission to perform an effect
  witness scripts/tests/native_command_tables.test.mjs checks every declared native owner table and Runtime's delegated table; ExternalEstate route-cost/participation/native tests, Spatial native test, SourceFrontier native test, WebSub optimized/ASan tests, Runtime and Queue dispatch tests, WebAddress native route tests, Provider smoke tests, Index native checks, LatentAtlas native tests, CMS native tests, Facet compiler and reader-agreement tests, Discipl composition test, Family native list and help checks, Attention smoke test, Admission smoke test, OperatorStore archive test, and Stitch native command checks exercise the descriptor cuts
  known_gap this is now a shared pattern adopted across the great majority of cmd/* owners; the ast-grep audit finds only 8 string comparisons remaining in 5 files, none of which are conversion candidates: cmd/BonfyreRecipe/tests/material_driver.c and cmd/BonfyreWebAddress/tests/participant_journey_test.c are test-fixture harnesses, cmd/BonfyreEconomy/src/main.c and cmd/BonfyreLearn/src/main.c retain a pre-shift `--db` option check rather than a verb, and cmd/BonfyreMcp/src/main.c already resolves its multi-call owners through a generic function-pointer table rather than a duplicated strcmp chain; Facet grammar-density currently reports content types without facts, and no live throughput gain has been measured from lookup alone
